silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_02_eight_corners_atlas_concrete_anchor_2#corner_010 silm:hasLongDescription "The Corner_010 is [virtual, individual, classification]: software architect with one specific object instance -- Mittens as a database row. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Corner_010', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
